    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d483-a6">

                <pb facs="0654" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg548"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 6.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Answer of that high body.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-01-12"><hi rendition="#italic">January 12,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Citizen</hi>: Having been brought to the
                    consideration of Congress in to-day’s session the resignation of the post of
                    President of the Republic that you presented on this date, it resolved
                    unanimously to accept said resignation, by virtue of the provisions of the
                    national constitution.</p>
                <p>I salute you, very attentively,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ramon A. Lovaton</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">President of Congress.</hi></signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Citizen <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carlos F. Morales L.</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">City.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
